.gradle/
build/
**/build/
*.class
*.log
.kotlin/
# Not part of this repo's own history — the generated RS3 API bindings (and the example built
# against them) are kept on disk for now since the local build still depends on them, but
# they're slated to move to their own repo eventually. settings.gradle.kts/build.gradle.kts
# only include/configure these projects when the directory actually exists, so the kt2lua
# build itself (cli/test-runner/build-logic) stays buildable without it — CI included.
/libs/runescape/
# Generated output from running the root examples/ demos through the CLI (--run/-o) — scratch,
# always regenerable from the matching .kt file, never meant to be committed.
/examples/*.lua
# `/.idea/*` (not `/.idea`) + a negation below — a flat `/.idea` ignore would stop git from
# ever looking inside the directory at all, which also hides the one file deliberately kept:
# icon.png, so the project shows kt2lua's own icon instead of a generic one in IntelliJ's
# project list/window frame for anyone who opens this repo there.
/.idea/*
!/.idea/icon.png
